C MP+relacq-ok
"POSITIVE CONTROL: both models must ALLOW this. The same message-passing program
 whose STALE outcome every model in this family forbids, but asked here for the
 outcome where the reader does see the data (r0=1 /\\ r1=1). An SC model that
 forbade everything would look identical to a correct one on the IRIW split beside
 it; this is what rules that out."
{ }
P0 (atomic_int* x, atomic_int* f) {
  atomic_store_explicit(x,1,memory_order_release);
  atomic_store_explicit(f,1,memory_order_release);
}
P1 (atomic_int* x, atomic_int* f) {
  int r0 = atomic_load_explicit(f,memory_order_acquire);
  int r1 = atomic_load_explicit(x,memory_order_acquire);
}
exists (1:r0=1 /\ 1:r1=1)
